# --- Live chat (Crisp-style widget) -----------------------------------------
# Base URL of the Zubair-Agent backend on Vercel, no trailing slash, e.g.
# https://your-agent.vercel.app — the widget talks to it for the shared
# visitor / Zubair AI / Zubair thread. Leave empty to run AI-only via /api/chat.
# This is a BUILD-TIME value: set it wherever `next build` runs, then redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_API_URL=
